-Nice=-20
-IOSchedulingClass=best-effort
-IOSchedulingPriority=0
+Nice=19
+IOSchedulingClass=idle
 # Section B's OOM ranking (2026-11-02): a helper carries a less protective value than the core
 # service's -900, so a host OOM caused by its own work kills it, never the daemon. Value: -500.
