-# Not confined by AppArmor: a Python program that runs cp, sync, systemctl and the sparrow CLI; its
-# profile is a follow-up (deploy/RECOVERY.md, "Exposure"). It keeps only the capabilities a copy
-# that preserves owners needs.
+# Not confined by AppArmor: a Python program that runs rsync, b3sum, sync and the sparrow CLI; its
+# profile is a follow-up (deploy/RECOVERY.md, "Exposure"). It reads files it does not own and
+# preserves no owners.
